## Checklist

- [ ] Item name = scope, not task detail
- [ ] Details in notes, not item name
- [ ] `/add item` exists for each `/report` line (check state table; multi-item block OK)
- [ ] Category spelling exact
- [ ] Progress and notes are factual
- [ ] State table updated after user confirms send

